.TH ABIGFANTERRYDAVIS 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.9" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
abigfanterrydavis \- the fan: identity guardian of ALI Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B abigfanterrydavis
.RI [ \-\-once ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates smuggle Debian strings back into the visible layer; the
fan re-stamps ALI hourly: os-release (version-preserving),
lsb-release, issue, motd (+mascot), hostname, grub distributor
config, greeter, sudoers. Apt compat (ID_LIKE, sources,
keyrings) is never touched. Pings when it repairs.
.SH FILES
.IR /run/ali-fan ,
.IR /var/log/fan.log
